<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.6">
<l>uṟṟa vuṟupiṇi nōykā ḷumakkoṉṟu collukēṉ kēṇmiṉ</l>
<l>peṟṟaṅkaḷ mēykkum pirāṉār pēṇun tirukkōyil kaṇṭīr</l>
<l>aṟṟa muraikkiṉṟē ṉiṉṉa māḻviṉai kāḷumak kiṅkōr</l>
<l>paṟṟillai kaṇṭīr naṭamiṉ paṇṭaṉṟu paṭṭiṉaṅ kāppē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Diseases that cause copious suffering!</l>
<l rend="indent">Listen, I have something to say to you!</l>
<l>Look at [this] holy temple that adores</l>
<l rend="indent">the Lord who grazed the cows!</l>
<l>Overwhelming Karma, I will say [this] one more time,</l>
<l rend="indent">Go on! Look! There is nothing here for you to take!</l>
<l>Unlike before, [this] maritime town has protection.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
